    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐόδους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όδοντος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with three teeth,
				three-pronged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεάγρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Ki.</u>
					2.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριόδους</span></b> , ὁ, as Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίαινα</span>
			, <i>trident,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				8(7).37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pae.</u>
				4.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσειδάνιος τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <i>trident, leister,</i> for spearing fish, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				220c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicr.
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				338
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				1408
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>D</u>
				8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
